      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        77.66929626464844,
        132.4346923828125,
        358.8624267578125,
        146.98768615722656
      ],
      "text": "Patient education Health education and counselling.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        77.66929626464844,
        154.04931640625,
        504.2263488769531,
        168.60231018066406
      ],
      "text": "Staff education Education, chart or visual reminder, educational tool and desktop",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        203.10240173339844,
        166.15931701660156,
        377.35015869140625,
        180.60231018066406
      ],
      "text": "aid for decision-making and reminder.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        77.66929626464844,
        187.6639404296875,
        478.9924011230469,
        202.21693420410156
      ],
      "text": "Material support  Food or financial support such as meals, food baskets, food",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        203.10240173339844,
        199.77394104003906,
        507.57366943359375,
        214.21693420410156
      ],
      "text": "supplements, food vouchers, transport subsidies, living allowance,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        203.10240173339844,
        211.77394104003906,
        377.4084777832031,
        226.21693420410156
      ],
      "text": "housing incentives or financial bonus.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        203.10240173339844,
        228.02589416503906,
        504.21435546875,
        242.46888732910156
      ],
      "text": "This support addresses indirect costs incurred by patients or their",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        203.10240173339844,
        240.02589416503906,
        481.2176818847656,
        254.46888732910156
      ],
      "text": "attendants in accessing health services and, possibly, tries to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        203.10240173339844,
        252.02589416503906,
        498.50634765625,
        266.4689025878906
      ],
      "text": "mitigate the consequences of income loss related to the disease.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        77.66929626464844,
        273.530517578125,
        405.8016357421875,
        288.0835266113281
      ],
      "text": "Psychological support  Counselling sessions or peer-group support.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        77.66929626464844,
        295.1451416015625,
        513.2914428710938,
        309.6981506347656
      ],
      "text": "Tracer  Communication with the patient, including home visit or via mobile",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        203.10240173339844,
        307.255126953125,
        501.70843505859375,
        321.6981506347656
      ],
      "text": "telephone communication such as SMS or telephone (voice) call.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        77.66929626464844,
        328.7597351074219,
        510.6866760253906,
        343.312744140625
      ],
      "text": "Digital medication  A digital medication monitor is a device that can measure the time",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        77.66929626464844,
        340.7597351074219,
        491.3354797363281,
        355.312744140625
      ],
      "text": "monitor between openings of the pill box. The medication monitor can",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        203.10240173339844,
        352.8697204589844,
        512.9592895507812,
        367.312744140625
      ],
      "text": "give audio reminders or send an SMS to remind the patient to take",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        203.10240173339844,
        364.8697204589844,
        490.1090087890625,
        379.312744140625
      ],
      "text": "medications, along with recording when the pill box is opened.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        399.0166931152344,
        371.074951171875,
        414.67669677734375
      ],
      "text": "Tracers and digital health interventions rather than VST",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        420.6086120605469,
        527.4284057617188,
        436.32763671875
      ],
      "text": "(98–105) (90,  Varied tracers were included in randomized controlled trials  and observational studies",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        433.80859375,
        527.1925659179688,
        449.5276184082031
      ],
      "text": "91, 106–110) . These interventions included, for instance, SMS, telephone calls or automated telephone",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.974921226501465,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        448.28460693359375,
        527.4090576171875,
        462.7276306152344
      ],
      "text": "reminders. Patients who missed appointments or failed to collect their medication received reminder",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        461.484619140625,
        527.4397583007812,
        475.9276428222656
      ],
      "text": "letters or home visits by health-care workers. Medication monitors or computer systems in the clinic",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        474.6846008300781,
        527.4454956054688,
        489.12762451171875
      ],
      "text": "were also used to aid health-care workers in tracing patients. Medication monitors can measure the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        487.8846130371094,
        527.4122924804688,
        502.32763671875
      ],
      "text": "time between openings of the pill box, give audio reminders, record when the pill box is opened or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        501.0845947265625,
        262.98114013671875,
        515.527587890625
      ],
      "text": "send SMS reminders to take medications.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        522.78857421875,
        527.14013671875,
        537.2315673828125
      ],
      "text": "There were higher rates of treatment success, treatment adherence and 2-month sputum conversion,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.982135772705078,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        535.9886474609375,
        527.214599609375,
        550.431640625
      ],
      "text": "and lower rates of mortality, loss to follow-up and drug resistance acquisition with tracers, either",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        549.1885986328125,
        443.8662414550781,
        563.631591796875
      ],
      "text": "through home visits or mobile telephone communication (SMS or telephone call).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        570.8925170898438,
        527.5336303710938,
        585.3355102539062
      ],
      "text": "When mobile telephone interventions were examined separately, there were higher rates of treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.97126293182373,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        584.092529296875,
        527.4976196289062,
        598.5355224609375
      ],
      "text": "success, cure and 2-month sputum conversion and lower rates of treatment failure, loss to follow-up,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.992847442626953,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        597.29248046875,
        527.4310913085938,
        611.7354736328125
      ],
      "text": "poor adherence and unfavourable outcomes with mobile telephone reminders as opposed to no",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        610.4924926757812,
        128.57318115234375,
        624.9354858398438
      ],
      "text": "intervention.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        632.196533203125,
        527.5386962890625,
        646.6395263671875
      ],
      "text": "Medication monitors had better rates of adherence and favourable outcomes, and combined",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        645.3964233398438,
        527.2748413085938,
        659.8394165039062
      ],
      "text": "interventions of SMS and medication monitors also showed better adherence compared to no",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        658.596435546875,
        131.58718872070312,
        673.0394287109375
      ],
      "text": "intervention.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        680.30029296875,
        527.3761596679688,
        694.7432861328125
      ],
      "text": "It should be noted, however, that only a small number of studies were available for all digital health",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        692.2244262695312,
        527.4163818359375,
        707.9434204101562
      ],
      "text": "(99) interventions. There was only one small randomized controlled trial   on which these data are based.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.945615768432617,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        706.700439453125,
        527.531005859375,
        721.1434326171875
      ],
      "text": "With all the digital interventions and tracers, including VST, it is important to preserve patient support",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.984138488769531,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        719.900390625,
        527.5393676757812,
        734.3433837890625
      ],
      "text": "and the ability of patients to interact with health-care workers. In fact, these digital interventions should",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.957568168640137,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        733.1004028320312,
        527.4398193359375,
        747.5433959960938
      ],
      "text": "be considered as tools to enable better communication with the health-care provider rather than as",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        746.30029296875,
        527.4278564453125,
        760.7432861328125
      ],
      "text": "replacements for other adherence interventions. In practice, it is expected that SMS, telephone calls",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        39.172698974609375,
        801.0170288085938,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "186 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43649291992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        170.0604705810547,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        172.25680541992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        326.14483642578125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Module 4: treatment and care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
